---
// src/components/Experience.astro
---
<section class="py-[120px] border-b border-border" id="work">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-num">01</div>
      <div class="sec-head-mid">
        <div class="sec-kicker">
          <span class="bar"></span>
          <span data-i18n="exp.kicker.label">Experience</span>
          <span class="meta">// 2023 → now</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="sec-title" data-i18n="exp.title">Shipping software across<br/><em>enterprise</em> domains.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-side">
        <div class="sec-stat"><span class="pulse"></span>Currently shipping at <b>PT Rivolta</b></div>
        <p class="sec-desc" data-i18n="exp.desc">Production judgment across enterprise backend systems, now extended into constrained and auditable applied AI.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-rule"></div>

    <!-- Independent Applied AI -->
    <article class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-10 py-9 border-t border-border first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 100ms">
      <div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent" data-i18n="exp.ai.date">Current independent build</div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.1] m-0 mb-1 font-normal" data-i18n="exp.ai.role">Software Engineer · Applied AI Project</h3>
        <div class="text-ink-dim text-sm mb-[18px]" data-i18n="exp.ai.company">Fineract AI Reports · Open source</div>
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-2.5">
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.ai.b1">Designed a constrained natural-language reporting workflow with <strong class="text-ink font-medium">semantic retrieval, LLM planning, policy enforcement</strong>, and structured response rendering.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.ai.b2">Built a project-owned catalog of <strong class="text-ink font-medium">25 approved capabilities and queries</strong>; the AI never generates or executes arbitrary SQL.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.ai.b3">Implemented production boundaries including read-only execution, office and PII scopes, JWT and API-key authorization, durable audit data, tracing, and fail-closed routing.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-[18px]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Rust</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">LLM Planning</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Voyage Embeddings</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">pgvector</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">AI Guardrails</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Tracing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- PT Rivolta -->
    <article class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-10 py-9 border-t border-border first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 fade-up" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
      <div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink-dim">
        <span data-i18n="exp.rivolta.date">Apr 2024</span> —
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-green
                     before:content-[''] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-green
                     before:shadow-[0_0_0_3px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-green)_30%,transparent)]"
              data-i18n="exp.rivolta.present">Present</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.1] m-0 mb-1 font-normal" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.role">Software Engineer</h3>
        <div class="text-ink-dim text-sm mb-[18px]" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.company">PT Rivolta Technology Solutions</div>
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-2.5">
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.b1">Built an <strong class="text-ink font-medium">enterprise event management platform</strong> in Spring Boot + PostgreSQL + Redis — participant registration, scheduling, and dynamic group assignment with <strong class="text-ink font-medium">RBAC</strong>, supporting <strong class="text-ink font-medium">thousands of participants</strong> across international events.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.b2">Engineered <strong class="text-ink font-medium">warehouse &amp; logistics microservices</strong> with Jersey, AWS Lambda, and MySQL — multi-legal-entity fulfillment assignment and intelligent warehouse selection.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.b3">Contributed to a <strong class="text-ink font-medium">financial services</strong> monolith in Spring Boot — loan pre-closure calculation modules and secure RESTful APIs for sensitive transaction processing.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.b4">Stood up internal <strong class="text-ink font-medium">starter templates</strong> (Express, React, Next, Spring Boot) with standardized CI/CD and best-practice docs for greenfield projects.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.rivolta.b5">Mentored <strong class="text-ink font-medium">3 interns</strong> on code review, debugging, and design patterns — MVC, Repository, DAO, Factory.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-[18px]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Spring Boot</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Jersey</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">AWS Lambda</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">MySQL</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Redis</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Microservices</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">RBAC / JWT</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Backend Engineer -->
    <article class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] gap-10 py-9 border-t border-border fade-up" style="transition-delay: 300ms">
      <div class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink-dim" data-i18n="exp.be.date">Aug 2023 — Feb 2025</div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.1] m-0 mb-1 font-normal" data-i18n="exp.be.role">Backend Engineer</h3>
        <div class="text-ink-dim text-sm mb-[18px]" data-i18n="exp.be.company">Java &amp; Spring Boot Developer</div>
        <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 grid gap-2.5">
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.be.b1">Built production-ready backend services with <strong class="text-ink font-medium">JWT &amp; RBAC</strong> authentication — secure user management and authorization workflows.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.be.b2">Developed RESTful APIs with optimized DB queries (PostgreSQL / MySQL), applying indexing and query-tuning strategies.</li>
          <li class="pl-5 relative text-ink-dim text-[15px] leading-[1.55] before:content-[''] before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[11px] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-accent" data-i18n="exp.be.b3">Applied <strong class="text-ink font-medium">clean architecture</strong> and <strong class="text-ink font-medium">SOLID</strong> principles for scalable, maintainable modules.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-[18px]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Java</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">Spring Boot</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">JWT</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">REST</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-dim px-2.5 py-[5px] border border-border-2 rounded-full">SOLID</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>
